  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stop Violence Against Women in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &quot;Stop Violence Against Women in Balochistan, Pakistan&quot; project aims to address the pervasive issue of violence against women specifically in the Balochistan province. The project duration is 24 months and will be implemented by Balochistan Rural Development Program. The project focuses on raising awareness, providing support services, strengthening local capacity, and advocating for policy reforms to create a safer environment for women in Balochistan, Pakistan</narrative>
  </description>
